[{"title":"同陈大巡宴饮于伦右溪樾森楼","author":"王渐逵","text":"越台春色映层峦，扶杖江头快一观。\n元礼风裁闻海内，子方人物重朝端。\n高情每注烟霞岛，逸驾遥归薜荔门。\n犹自从容慰迂散，瓦瓶烧茗对温言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1338,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻云谷新成约何古林同居","author":"王渐逵","text":"伦子新成云谷窝，扫开骈翳待王何。\n数来贤圣还能几，静后工夫岂在多。\n不向炉前重作灶，任教门外可张罗。\n呼童著意栽松竹，记取他年绿满阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1339,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵东台携酒过访诗以谢之","author":"王渐逵","text":"长夏散幽况，泛舟石桥西。\n好风亦如閒，相与来树间。\n玄蝉送清韵，丹荔垂芳妍。\n况逢贤主人，契谊相懿敦。\n绸缪款嘉宴，兼得承惠言。\n寒泉有馀洌，溽暑无蕴烦。\n翛然游物表，我思穆以玄。\n愿得藉辉光，曲阿澹神诠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1340,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏见江携酒过访诗以谢之","author":"王渐逵","text":"名园萧旷甲三城，文宴高贤雅调庚。\n荔圃露团新月上，柳桥云度惠风生。\n疏峰断送楼台暑，野服弥深水石情。\n自笑迂慵承款眷，愧将蘅社结芳盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1341,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约东台见江","author":"王渐逵","text":"岳伯黄门吾所慕，萝山乡土得相同。\n才名磊落今苏彻，文艺精深旧雪松。\n画解华簪依鹄鹭，欲将颓运入鸿濛。\n不嫌幽僻重相过，扫石烹茶荐晚风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1342,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"席中和方丹山韵","author":"王渐逵","text":"玉坛金简咏曾城，仙侣飘飘取次赓。\n瑶圃有书青鸟度，银河无浪白榆生。\n风埃自惜增凡气，花鸟于今亦世情。\n欲向广庭访真诀，露浓寒重不堪盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1343,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云谷偶成","author":"王渐逵","text":"空谷罕人迹，荔荫当午浓。\n驻云窥石榻，落叶戏儿童。\n风送渡江雨，僧来入定钟。\n几番幽兴在，浑欲忘归蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1344,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中有怀白斋古林","author":"王渐逵","text":"停午海云起，淋浪竟夕连。\n水添惊宿鹭，风急乱鸣蝉。\n舟楫忆昨日，阴晴异一天。\n支颐撩尔思，剪烛不成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1345,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜泛舟同伦右溪赋","author":"王渐逵","text":"歧浦乱相迷，萧深古瀼西。\n露寒明月港，风簇落花堤。\n醉影疑行镜，残更已报鸡。\n君应怜谬误，吾欲竟幽栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1346,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乡回东台见江携酒过饮为别次韵","author":"王渐逵","text":"潇潇侣群雁，芦花烟渚深。\n月明怜共影，波泛尔何心。\n南去稻粱远，北来星汉阴。\n相依乡国地，宁复叹商参。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1347,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵山会讲学者四人方西樵邓敬所何古林与予时甘露连降于紫云楼之松者三日方西樵有诗乃续而赓之","author":"王渐逵","text":"大渊之岁，厥月惟玄。\n泰风肇扬，于昭朗宣。\n方叔元老，寔秉斯虔。\n感我良朋，翕至后先。\n于以共约，于樵之巅。\n于以会之，于石之泉。\n方叔敬德，冲和有融。\n上帝监尔，精明幽通。\n不虫不瘁，先兆于松。\n甘露溶溶，紫云葱葱。\n爰降爰注，于公之宫。\n有孚我朋，类银其从。\n甘露连连，有盈三日。\n既渥既足，维松维乔。\n感我良朋，于焉逍遥。\n甘露连连，有盈三日。\n既渥既同，惟心惟一。\n感我良朋，于焉丽泽。\n同德之磋，如气之和。\n同德之涵，如露之甘。\n君子之孚，君子之祉。\n何以侑之，德音孔迩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1348,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送伦穗石出社京行","author":"王渐逵","text":"樾森台馆共相期，新月那堪管别离。\n鸿雁尽随征客舸，荔花先荐远人卮。\n清平郊野春正月，礼乐文章旧漠仪。\n犹自慇勤寻社会，为君沉醉重题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1349,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈希周 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"危机潜伏正须闲，主敬工夫得最难。\n莫谓良知还便了，良知尤隔一重关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1350,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈希周 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"浇培应向玄根时，讲贯由来岂外驰。\n君看寄生无瘠者，却于何处觅新枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1351,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈希周 其三","author":"王渐逵","text":"太虚灵象正融熙，争奈浮云混浊时。\n若向此中寻乐处，须从无欲立根基。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1352,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈希周 其四","author":"王渐逵","text":"添承抽铅吾自有，作灶起炉何所求。\n我爱延平深晦养，好将真诀契前脩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1353,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓望","author":"王渐逵","text":"芦渚荃汀闻罢钟，披衣凝望谩推篷。\n赤日已射珊瑚树，明星尚照芙蓉峰。\n帆影飒飒趁潮渡，众声活活抛鱼翁。\n此时独立长秋兴，况复雁凫生野丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1354,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有闻","author":"王渐逵","text":"汉达官军总制明，健儿十万下沧溟。\n旌旂络绎蛟螭伏，鼓角喧腾海若惊。\n瘴穴昏藤迂日月，木魈岩魅费经营。\n未闻黎母开平宴，慷慨越山吟老生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1355,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠百有二岁翁蕳术斋","author":"王渐逵","text":"世上难逢百岁人，越城今喜两相亲。\n六朝往事资闻见，太古淳风羡海滨。\n大鉴逃禅终示寂，安期采药亦非真。\n何如鹤发苍松老，满长儿孙盛世民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1356,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿伦穗石","author":"王渐逵","text":"梅花独荐嘉平酒，贺客群登顺孝堂。\n子固文章孚众望，窦家兄弟共联芳。\n春风满座人如醉，煦日单衣岁协祥。\n笑我爱贤心未已，预为邦国一称觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1357,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠督学蔡可泉","author":"王渐逵","text":"忆昔寓京洛，同官西曹院。\n君年富英妙，词藻动畿甸。\n暌别叹旬载，越海欣一见。\n储歛日已深，煦闰溢颜面。\n学士资绪馀，诸生启模宪。\n古称德润身，君子重豹变。\n说泽方自兹，离索复相远。\n知崇而礼卑，持此信精鍊。\n临岐更踟蹰，瞩望增眷恋。\n涧毛虽云微，可以供一饯。\n江淅尚玄悟，学者群宗之。\n讵知了性命，乃与日月宜。\n奇珍匪尝口，绚霞岂能衣。\n古来齐鲁论，心事未云岐。\n达士抱以脩，浊世相乖痴。\n君看百尺楼，下有栋与基。\n玄谈竟无益，顿悟亦何为。\n隐语互相倡，无乃堕禅机。\n君生群哲乡，大途宁更疑。\n懋矣炳前脩，新知信相期。\n不惜远书札，启我衰钝资。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1358,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪张顾二藩伯宴饮樾森楼次伦穗石韵 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"千旌文旆映林间，荔渚荷汀亦籍颜。\n已见楼台将暑去，却怜风雨载秋还。\n逍遥上客星辰履，寂寞潜夫薛荔关。\n夜后怀贤何处是，白云迢递看高山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1359,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪张顾二藩伯宴饮樾森楼次伦穗石韵 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"硕望瞻依岭海间，高秋临眺共开颜。\n好贤水石自清媚，侍宴云霞互往还。\n枰局岂堪稽逸驾，茑萝如欲翳重关。\n光仪玄论多相挹，不负山人再出山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1360,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云谷寄伦右溪","author":"王渐逵","text":"云谷初开越秀边，苍榕丹荔郁森连。\n山灵已许吾为主，天下争如子爱贤。\n世外观棋应有日，松根煨芋到何年。\n从今喜学栖霞相，杖挂红霓帽顶天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1361,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿樾森楼柬伦右溪白山昆仲","author":"王渐逵","text":"少壮追随汗漫游，宁将出处问丹丘。\n才华子合重归国，衰懒吾堪寄此楼。\n载酒不妨连夜醉，有身焉用百年忧。\n诗成朗月清风外，付与儿孙次第讴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1362,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮伦樾溪园亭","author":"王渐逵","text":"名园新巀思公子，华宴遥开樾水滨。\n白李红桃纡碧洞，曲池文榭映青春。\n笙箫缥缈吹芳霭，帘幕深沉隔软尘。\n授简不须频刻烛，右丞诗画愧传真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1363,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云谷谒白沙先生祠","author":"王渐逵","text":"山川本非异，有仙则以灵。\n形胜匪所钟，有贤则以名。\n兹山秀磅礴，屹立南海滨。\n乌利著玄迹，紫姑扬其声。\n崇祠敞以搆，于今见先生。\n倡道明东南，岭峤开人文。\n耳目去支离，灵根养元精。\n可以继往圣，岂与仙幻并。\n后学讵何幸，两梦通幽诚。\n启我以温颜，饮我以淳真。\n求之不可见，想像杳仪形。\n焚香肃再拜，长谢肆造恩。\n徘徊不能去，感此多良朋。\n欲卜此山阿，永言面阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1364,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风吟和冼少汾并寄少汾同社诸君 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"树作亭台山作城，春来岩壑更妍清。\n棠梨一夜催花发，多谢东风太有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1365,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风吟和冼少汾并寄少汾同社诸君 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"桃李霏霏映水乡，天机泼泼动诗肠。\n闲随老社占年去，遥对东风共一觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1366,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风吟和冼少汾并寄少汾同社诸君 其三","author":"王渐逵","text":"山溪黯淡人迹稀，溪头野人单袷衣。\n徘徊日暮浑无事，却与东风逐队归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1367,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风吟和冼少汾并寄少汾同社诸君 其四","author":"王渐逵","text":"自从容谷少来音，云馆烟扉卧夕阴。\n惟有东风旧相识，漫随明月温江浔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1368,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东风吟和冼少汾并寄少汾同社诸君 其五","author":"王渐逵","text":"桂长丛枝竹长荪，山中怀抱向谁论。\n东风似却知人意，时捲云霞独闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1369,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观泉亭四时吟 其一 春","author":"王渐逵","text":"烟扉霞馆散晴春，淡日融风岸葛巾。\n柳外黄鹂如唤友，溪边红翠欲窥人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1370,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观泉亭四时吟 其二 夏","author":"王渐逵","text":"绿藻芳深玉鲫肥，荔枝红压钓鱼玑。\n采莲人去歌声慢，凉月香风满载归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1371,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观泉亭四时吟 其三 秋","author":"王渐逵","text":"爽籁萧深逸兴豪，菊花对酒未能醄。\n曲肱小阁孤亭上，倒看两厓秋气高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1372,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观泉亭四时吟 其四 冬","author":"王渐逵","text":"桃花开映小阳月，荔萼丛生大雪天。\n橘绿橙黄应不数，将诗评品入新年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺李三洲新居","author":"王渐逵","text":"岁德自临星纪次，文明先丽祝融宫。\n飞翚翼翼含朝旭，骈榭融融散景风。\n绿野未宜归晋国，锦堂吾欲寄韩公。\n邺侯秘籍由来盛，应许迂儒杖履从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访冼少汾二仲台同何古林","author":"王渐逵","text":"联舟渡汾水，驾言访玄同。\n夜静促肩舆，得与合簪共。\n逶迤历修轸，徘徊转遥葑。\n羡君敞三径，愧我非二仲。\n剪烛语疑契，对酒乐哦诵。\n寒飙袭轻裙，白露泫以重。\n河横天宇清，南斗仰初中。\n旷怀释百虑，灏气寂群动。\n欲别闻晨难，役役悲倥偬。\n翘首骈萝堤，叹息如寐梦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访白云书院","author":"王渐逵","text":"白云奠南服，自古肇灵胜。\n一据浮图氏，遂堕空寂径。\n况沦二千年，人寰足深病。\n烈烈甘泉翁，书院烈以正。\n排云搆华宫，中天启元圣。\n兢兢诵法同，济济衣冠盛。\n我来慰一观，良朋翕相应。\n源泉酌清漪，大宇喜澄定。\n一杯洒空台，遥为山灵庆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题安期生","author":"王渐逵","text":"安生远避世，采药再不回。\n骑鹤入白云，九里为之开。\n秦皇徒朽质，汉武非仙才。\n灵踪竟玄秘，方士空疑猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重登第一山","author":"王渐逵","text":"一峰高耸万重岭，满目云烟紫翠连。\n会见图书归太极，即看嵩岳向中天。\n游当白帝三秋外，人在招摇北斗边。\n诗罢山灵应独慰，直从开辟萃诸贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"近日见此德之所以不进者只是此心原不洁静故欲来染之是以未得清明潇洒之乐因思程子云凡有意向皆是欲欲心甚惕然每念平时作诗文著述欲自见之于世周理人事欲得而不失者皆是欲也方欲打点搜出一洗而空之而伦樾溪适柬至云昨梦有司为子起牌坊先拟行道二字为扁仆不可乃以无欲扁之噫岂天意有造于予乎哉夫无欲之义周子为以学圣之要而程子又发明之可谓尽矣吾人循此自立乃圣贤之正脉路也因作诗以答于樾溪复以自警云","author":"王渐逵","text":"神明自灵彻，邪欲乃玷之。\n上圣本不染，晶晶著先几。\n中贤一以涅，先濯乃其宜。\n须臾岂容间，其功在缉熙。\n寡之以又寡，无欲成镃基。\n无无复无无，至一以为期。\n天地得此一，贞观陶化机。\n圣人合其德，位育夫何疑。\n托梦有深造，上帝岂吾欺。\n所欲不在多，二三已云岐。\n所同即是欲，程氏真吾师。\n感君敦夙好，功磋及其时。\n作诗以自佩，顾諟常在兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访湛甘泉翁上唐山居 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"北郭山川凝永夏，上唐门苍染深丛。\n清泉数道鸣寒涧，乔木千寻落午风。\n金液池边闲白鸟，马家园上翳青松。\n甘泉夫子方寻乐，吾道年来得所宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访湛甘泉翁上唐山居 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"肩舆遥度越山崔，野色岚光拨不开。\n古壁重留丞相记，绿阴高护尚书台。\n馌耕浓向交畦聚，听讲云从独鸟来。\n翻忆往年冬至梦，淳醪真饮石翁杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王岱麓之苍梧访应儆庵","author":"王渐逵","text":"湖平风静蓼花初，曙色珠光映海隅。\n鳌背寺边逢学士，膻羊江上访龙图。\n殊方别袂情应属，万里同年兴不孤。\n莫向苍梧思帝子，九嶷疑望隔仙都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"项瓯东过访诗以谢之 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"使君高谊出尘寰，绿磴扪萝独扣关。\n玄论任教玄鸟听，白袍真共白鸥闲。\n尊罍尽列依荃渚，旌节相忘隐鹭湾。\n自幸野人深此会，不携舟楫入青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"项瓯东过访诗以谢之 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"玉局真官下五羊，朱明仙客共徜徉。\n云霞掩映玄班侍，林樾深沉翠盖张。\n两部蛙声来鼓吹，一溪花影自霓裳。\n白云越秀休相讶，迟尔山灵半日忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸君绎思堂避暑","author":"王渐逵","text":"拂拂东风暑气收，翠云芳霭沃丹丘。\n空阶自足清泠世，短榻能轻万户侯。\n歌入沧浪千盏废，数来黄绮几人留。\n神仙福地应如此，肯向鲸波羡十洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约诸公相过连日阴雨忽晴 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"一日晴虽暂，联杯意自深。\n雨应怜客驾，天亦慰吾心。\n竹浒蒸霞气，风坛散夕阴。\n尚馀无尽兴，宿鸟助清吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约诸公相过连日阴雨忽晴 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"曙色凝高树，晶晶辉气深。\n夹旬惊见日，异地少论心。\n荔子初垂颗，薇花半着阴。\n只因朋旧好，来伴白头吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1387,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕二首 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"几年犹住樾森楼，红叶潇潇旅馆幽。\n坏辙已灰康世念，蠹鱼长带老生愁。\n不将诗句题孤屿，欲为仙人赋十洲。\n隐几焚香惊换岁，慇勤深夜一灯留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1388,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕二首 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"孤城为客未从容，几度思春春正逢。\n缑岭自应归子晋，河汾今已老文中。\n呼童早辨看山屐，载橐遥携刻石工。\n便向青萝依大隐，即从中洞访双峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1389,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日祝圣台和泉翁韵","author":"王渐逵","text":"杓衡初转三阳候，象纬遥森午夜天。\n玉篆烟开怜此日，景阳钟听忆先年。\n风生鳷鹊含朝旭，云起蓬莱望羽仙。\n廿载圣恩何以答，祝馀高卧种瓜田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1390,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日登山独酌","author":"王渐逵","text":"人日登山兴倍浓，携壶无伴独呼童。\n葭灰已转三阳候，云树犹含少女风。\n海外烟波擎凤岛，人间楼馆杂歌钟。\n吟馀扫石聊趺坐，涧草岩花款醉容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1391,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿岑浦谷二首 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"少小才名动海崖，山川灵孕羡南离。\n化分周室东西陜，道著虞庭礼乐司。\n腊荐嘉平春酒盎，池开六脉瑞光奇。\n商颜绮角闲相伴，共向东风问紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿岑浦谷二首 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"君辞北阙归沧海，我亦移家向穗城。\n世事转篷人易老，梅花催酒客初醒。\n剧谈共对班荆坐，万虑空馀入社情。\n更喜祝融开寿域，即看南斗避文星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同六舍弟卜居城西二首 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"城西旧游地，爱此足清幽。\n卜筑成新构，栖迟协素谋。\n稻花随应户，秋水可通舟。\n犹自欢邻里，新醅酒正刍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同六舍弟卜居城西二首 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"区分虽井闬，潇旷自村家。\n列树遥团盖，栖禽似报衙。\n里人新约社，稚子旋栽花。\n兄弟欢娱地，吾生未有涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜诸公过西园二首 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"飞盖出平沙，垂绅散落霞。\n野人趋迓客，稚子解烹茶。\n高秋馀橘柚，小港近鱼虾。\n新酿能相继，尊空不用赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜诸公过西园二首 其二","author":"王渐逵","text":"交深不责备，脱洒每相忘。\n旅石随便坐，脩林独荐凉。\n看山因得句，对水或流觞。\n不为孤城隔，那知叹夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题泉翁天湖亭 其一","author":"王渐逵","text":"万派千流共一途，渊然深注自天湖。\n向来疏壑元无用，始信人间落有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":1398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]